/*
 * SignBridge: flex + MPU6500 recognition, LCD replies, optional haptics,
 * and a self-contained Wi-Fi website. Target: classic ESP32 Dev Module.
 * Install only "esp32 by Espressif Systems" (Arduino core 3.x).
 *
 * Flex T/I/M/R/P: 33/35/36/34/32. MOVE MIDDLE FROM GPIO25 TO GPIO36.
 * MPU SDA/SCL: 21/22. LCD SDA/SCL: 18/19. Motor DRIVER control: 26.
 * Join Wi-Fi SignBridge, password signbridge, open http://192.168.4.1.
 * Keep hand flat, straight and still during startup calibration.
 * No gesture training: 4 hand shapes (fist, point, pinky, index+pinky) and
 * 4 motions (wave, flip, nod, shake) are fixed rules. The chosen environment
 * (everyday, hospital, market, restaurant, classroom) sets each gesture's phrase.
 * Serial 115200: p readings, d motion details, c calibrate, s status,
 * e1..e5 environment, q cancel, ? help (then Enter).
 * Phrase table below is generated from signbridge/public/js/gestures.js.
 *
 * Website below is generated by: node scripts/embed-web.mjs
 * This ONE .ino is all you need to compile and flash; no filesystem upload.
 */
